"cli.usage" = "VideoLoggerFCP — local converter for one LosslessCut v2 project\nUsage: videologger SOURCE.llc [--media VIDEO.MP4] [--output RESULT.fcpxml]\n                     [--event-name NAME | --event NAME] [--stringout]\nBy default, mediaFileName is resolved beside .llc; output is saved in the LLC folder.\nOutput name: SOURCE.fcpxml or SOURCE-stringout.fcpxml with --stringout.\n--output specifies the full output path in another existing folder.\n--event is an alias for --event-name; without either option, the Event uses the LLC basename.\nKeyword Ranges include every segment. Stringout includes only selected=true segments.\nExisting output and source files are never overwritten.";
"mediaFileName must contain only a filename; use --media for another location." = "mediaFileName must contain only a filename; use --media for another location.";
"off" = "off";
"⌘/⇧-click to select multiple recordings and segments. LLC times are checked against exact frames before dragging." = "⌘/⇧-click to select multiple recordings and segments. LLC times are checked against exact frames before dragging.";
